-638ef8f4923a:d00\", \"start\": 323, \"end\": 500, \"text\": \"MBK Entertainment released a statement saying, “Jiyeon’s solo concept is sexy and will be similar to Park Jiyoon’s 'Coming of Age Ceremony\\\", but with a modern 2014-esque twist.”\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0099-638ef8f4923a:d00\", \"start\": 501, \"end\": 560, \"text\": \"On May 20, 2014 the extended play \\\"Never Ever\\\" was released\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0099-638ef8f4923a:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0099-638ef8f4923a:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Park Ji-yeon\", \"scope\": \"Artist of the \\\"Never Ever\\\" EP\", \"claim\": \"Never Ever is the debut EP by Park Ji-yeon.\", \"answer\": \"Park Ji-yeon\", \"quote\": \"Never Ever (Jiyeon EP) Never Ever is the debut EP by Park Ji-yeon.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"current_answers\": [\"Park Ji-yeon\"], \"candidate_answers\": [{\"candidate_id\": \"R0\", \"answer\": \"Park Ji-yeon\", \"origin\": \"initial\"}]}"
